Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.54,1:23:05.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, I I I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.60,1:23:09.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Like she still has like a lot of brand and there's a lot of, you know, power and like makes a lot of margin.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.88,1:23:10.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.06,1:23:16.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,like as long as the the labs like repeatedly can launch new models and as long as the margin that they have
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.43,1:23:22.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,on those models are such that they they can sort of pay off amortize like that the cost of training those models,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.10,1:23:24.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,it could still be like a decent business, I think.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.80,1:23:27.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, you don't think that the intelligence is like plateauing?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.84,1:23:29.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,No, I don't I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.61,1:23:31.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,I mean, I I think it remains to be seen, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.56,1:23:40.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Like models that today are like very good at like doing things that can be trained very efficiently, you know, using reinforcement learning.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.12,1:23:44.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, so we've seen that initially with, you know, coding and writing simple snippets.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.63,1:23:47.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,Over time it's gotten really good at also writing production line level code.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.03,1:23:49.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's gotten really good at math.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.00,1:23:53.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's gotten really good at cybersecurity.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.16,1:23:55.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Like these are all like very quite verifiable things.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.60,1:24:03.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,I I still think it remains to be seen, you know, are models going to be really good at whatever, cooking food or I I I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.82,1:24:08.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Like things that have like more like diffuse targets that maybe longer feedback loops or whatever.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.56,1:24:16.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,I think humans probably like my feeling is like we'll be quite good and quite competitive with with models for a long time in those domains.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.75,1:24:20.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,But, you know, certainly you know, AI models they're they're getting there.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.90,1:24:21.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,They're very good.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.65,1:24:23.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,As as I'm sure everyone can agree with.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.32,1:24:26.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah, so obviously like the models are getting really good at coding.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.05,1:24:27.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,They're already really good at coding.
