Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.12,1:25:02.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,I mean like I think like material science is like maybe another area where like you have a little bit of that loop where you can sort of, you know,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.28,1:25:08.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,synthetically manufacture certain materials and measure the properties and you just kind of put an agent in the loop and like, you know, do things.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.93,1:25:12.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,So so you know, I have a physics background I'm pretty excited about that.
